          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nila nikumona nikutiya, mbuulu wumu hakutúuka hakachi kaluzwizu, hakuhosha nezu datiyakana nindi, ihuŋu! Ihuŋu! Ihuŋu! Mahuŋu akamonawu awa ekala hamaseki nanoku kuvuma kwakavuma mpiuŋa jikwawu jawaŋelu asatu anashaluhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
